  "DataTypeProcNameStrHint": "When selected for a column where the process name is saved, you can use label plot drawing and filters for all number plots without setting.",
  "Data export confirm msg with periodic": "Data will be exported according to the following schedule.\n\nNext 3 runs:\n\n",
