  "RelationshipTypeNToOneTooltip": "Use when multiple records in the Prev Process links to a single record in the Post Process.\nWhen visualizing both process together, charts are plotted at the N-side record level.\nExample: Element-wise data -> Circuit board-wise data\nExample: Circuit board-wise data -> Module-wise data",
